        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 802AVH, Avalon Dummy Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stylish handleset features edged rectangle mounts. With solid brass construction, it will last for many years to come. Dummy cylinder handleset is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:  \r\n<a href=\"/products/avalon-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800avh\"><b>Avalon Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Avalon Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 802AVH Avalon Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 18-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 12-13/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Deadbolt to Center of Top Plate: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt:  8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
